- Native VU1: a block entry without native code (an entry the generator cannot find, such as a jump through a register)
  is appended to <GOW_VU1_CAPTURA>/vu1n_heads_seen.txt; the pipeline merges those with the profile's vu1n_heads.txt
  (it was not passed at all after the move to data/<game>/: 28 blocks of ship combat ran in the interpreter and every
  native run left and re-entered, ~1.2 M times per 5 s).
- SPU2 mixer: advanceTo mixes into a batch and appends it to the output with one lock per call instead of one per
  sample (48,000 lock/unlock pairs a second on the game thread, contended by the audio device thread).
- PS2X_RELEASE_PDB: Release with debug information (/Z7, /DEBUG:FULL) for profilers (build.cmd -Pdb); same code.
Measured on the ship (Xeon E5-2666 v3, RX 580, 2x, with 05 and 06): combat 52-57 -> 55-60 fps.

